From: EglantinePS5 <noreply@eglantineps5.local>
Subject: [PATCH] Migrate 0302-mesh-guard.patch

Source: 0302-mesh-guard.patch
Core patch, after 0301. Off with EDEN_NX2_MESH_AS_COMPUTE unset: nothing here runs then.

0301's vkCmdDrawIndirect is a draw site 0200 could not know: with EDEN_NX2_PIPELINE_FAIL_SOFT=1 it
now drops the draw when the bound graphics pipeline failed to build, like the other sites.

Also: MakeMeshComputePipelines runs on a pipeline worker and RecordMeshComputePasses does not wait
for it. It made the mesh pipeline first, so a draw in that window saw mesh_pipeline set and
task_pipeline empty and ran the mesh pass with no task pass or table. The mesh pipeline is now made
last, so a set mesh_pipeline means the others are there, also when a later build throws.

Found by reading only. Not run.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

diff --git a/src/video_core/renderer_vulkan/vk_graphics_pipeline.cpp b/src/video_core/renderer_vulkan/vk_graphics_pipeline.cpp
index 3c029a2280..6463a36100 100644
--- a/src/video_core/renderer_vulkan/vk_graphics_pipeline.cpp
+++ b/src/video_core/renderer_vulkan/vk_graphics_pipeline.cpp
@@ -1305,11 +1305,13 @@ void GraphicsPipeline::MakeMeshComputePipelines() {
         };
         return device.GetLogical().CreateComputePipeline(compute_ci, *pipeline_cache);
     };
-    mesh_pipeline = make(mesh_compute->mesh, true);
+    // The mesh pipeline last: this runs on a worker, RecordMeshComputePasses does not wait for it,
+    // and it takes a set mesh_pipeline to mean the draw's other pipelines are there too.
     if (mesh_compute->task) {
         task_pipeline = make(mesh_compute->task, true);
         scan_pipeline = make(mesh_compute->scan, false);
     }
+    mesh_pipeline = make(mesh_compute->mesh, true);
 }
 
 // Records the draw's compute passes (mesh_compute_layout.h) before its render pass: the scratch
diff --git a/src/video_core/renderer_vulkan/vk_rasterizer.cpp b/src/video_core/renderer_vulkan/vk_rasterizer.cpp
index 511926b2d2..461e1c54c2 100644
--- a/src/video_core/renderer_vulkan/vk_rasterizer.cpp
+++ b/src/video_core/renderer_vulkan/vk_rasterizer.cpp
@@ -983,7 +983,10 @@ void RasterizerVulkan::Draw(bool is_indexed, u32 instance_count) {
                                 num_instances);
                 }
             }
-            scheduler.Record([draw = mesh_compute_draw](vk::CommandBuffer cmdbuf) {
+            scheduler.Record([this, draw = mesh_compute_draw](vk::CommandBuffer cmdbuf) {
+                if (scheduler.GraphicsPipelineMissing()) {
+                    return;
+                }
                 cmdbuf.DrawIndirect(draw.buffer, draw.offset, 1, sizeof(VkDrawIndirectCommand));
             });
             return;
